  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(3.7)3 - 3 × (3.7)2 × (0.7) + 3(3.7) × (0.7)2 - (0.7)³\n\n**Concept Used:**\n\n(a – b)³ = a³ – b³ – 3a²b + 3ab²\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nFor the given expression, comparing it with the formula of (a – b)³,\n\n⇒ (3.7)3 - 3 × (3.7)2 × (0.7) + 3(3.7) × (0.7)2 - (0.7)³\n\n⇒ a = 3.7 and b = 0.7\n\n⇒ (3.7)3 - 3 × (3.7)2 × (0.7) + 3(3.7) × (0.7)2 - (0.7)³ = (3.7 – 0.7)³\n\n⇒ (3.7 – 0.7)³ = 3³ = 27\n\n**Therefore, the required value is 27.**",
